{"parse":{"title":"极限解放/鹰隼绝路","pageid":8926,"revid":21931,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E9%B9%B0%E9%9A%BC%E7%BB%9D%E8%B7%AF&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E9%B9%B0%E9%9A%BC%E7%BB%9D%E8%B7%AF&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E9%B9%B0%E9%9A%BC%E7%BB%9D%E8%B7%AF&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>鹰隼绝路</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.B9.B0.E9.9A.BC.E7.BB.9D.E8.B7.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"鹰隼绝路\"><b>鹰隼绝路</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">极限解放详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"3\"><img alt=\"极限解放 鹰隼绝路.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/71/n63wh1o6155a1mqcpnb5q27dr2bcsay.png/80px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E9%B9%B0%E9%9A%BC%E7%BB%9D%E8%B7%AF.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/71/n63wh1o6155a1mqcpnb5q27dr2bcsay.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E9%B9%B0%E9%9A%BC%E7%BB%9D%E8%B7%AF.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/71/n63wh1o6155a1mqcpnb5q27dr2bcsay.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />鹰隼绝路\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，物攻提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，暴击率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。使用[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职能技能</span>]时，能量消耗减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>（最低降为1点）。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增减时，所增减的值转为同等层数的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">鹰隼</font></span>]，每累积<font color=\"#ed7950\">14</font>层，消耗并获得<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量，且所有技能冷却减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。<br />✦被攻击时，若攻击方拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>个及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，则自身受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。<br />✦攻击拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>个及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]的目标时，伤害、暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>；若目标拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>个及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]时，效果翻倍。<br />✦使用含有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]的技能时，若目标可免疫该[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，则以[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">普攻</span>]进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">追击</span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，物攻提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，暴击率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。使用[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职能技能</span>]时，产生的冷却回合、能量消耗减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>（最低降为1点）。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增减时，所增减的值转为同等层数的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">鹰隼</font></span>]，每累积<font color=\"#ed7950\">12</font>层，消耗并获得<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量，且所有技能冷却减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。<br />✦被攻击时，若攻击方拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>个及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，则自身受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>。<br />✦攻击拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>个及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]的目标时，伤害、暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>；若目标拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>个及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]时，效果翻倍。<br />✦使用含有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]的技能时，若目标可免疫该[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，则以[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">普攻</span>]进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">追击</span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，物攻提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，暴击率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。使用[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职能技能</span>]时，产生的冷却回合、能量消耗减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>（最低降为1点）。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增减时，所增减的值转为同等层数的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">鹰隼</font></span>]，每累积<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层，消耗并获得<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量，且所有技能冷却减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。<br />✦被攻击时，若攻击方拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>个及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，则自身受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。<br />✦攻击拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>个及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]的目标时，伤害、暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>；若目标拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>个及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]时，效果翻倍。<br />✦使用含有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]的技能时，若目标可免疫该[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，则以[<span style=\"display:inline;white-sp